# Build-context filter for roshera-backend/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the context's .dockerignore).
#
# The context is the REPO ROOT, because api-server compiles in
# roshera-agent-policy.md from there (goose_acp.rs: include_str! of
# CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR/../../roshera-agent-policy.md). This is an ALLOWLIST:
# only the backend workspace and that one file are sent, never roshera-app,
# node_modules or a local target/ (which has reached 85 GB).
*
!roshera-agent-policy.md
!roshera-backend/
roshera-backend/target/
roshera-backend/**/target/
roshera-backend/exports/
roshera-backend/**/*.log
